  "prefLabel": "Pos 1501.07 Continued Eligibility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pos 1501.07 Continued Eligibility.\n\n(a) A recipient of a prior award, who continues to work as a CART provider or sign language interpreter shall continue to be eligible for a maximum of 5 years.\n\n(b) For continued eligibility, a prior recipient shall annually submit an application by the deadline specified in Pos 1501.05.\n\nSource. #9677, eff 3-13-10",
